  "details": "I think VRChat should bring back the ability to select and interact with users through walls, both in VR and on PC.\n\nOn PC, this should also work outside of menus. For example, when someone is constantly doing annoying animations, gestures, or other disruptive actions, we currently have to physically find them and walk over to them just to select, mute, or block them.\n\nBeing able to select a user through walls would be a major quality-of-life improvement, especially in crowded worlds or when the person is difficult to locate.\n\nThis could still have safeguards to prevent abuse, but having this option available again would make managing interactions much easier.",
